                        ],
                        "form": "выдыха́вши"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "404fde1e-d8dc-460a-a23b-157960e4db86",
                        "entry_id": "2260fb0d-35d6-3be3-b3f4-59adbe584333",
                        "tags": [
                            "future"
                        ],
                        "form": "буду/будешь… выдыха́ть"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "79f1b26a-3503-3d88-9822-ac5b063430b0",
                        "entry_id": "2260fb0d-35d6-3be3-b3f4-59adbe584333",
                        "glosses": [
                            "дыханием выталкивать воздух из лёгких, выделять при дыхании"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "507560c7-d026-498d-836e-1c874ab03faf",
                                "sense_id": "79f1b26a-3503-3d88-9822-ac5b063430b0",
                                "text": "Ротик приоткрыт, к нижней губе пристала пушинка; когда девушка выдыхала, пушинка становилась «на дыбки» и смешно дрожала."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "54ea811c-335f-4526-81d4-8f79e8b08813",
                                "sense_id": "79f1b26a-3503-3d88-9822-ac5b063430b0",
                                "text": "Его носоглотка и легкие работали идеально, исправно вдыхали и выдыхали воздух."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30a5ee30-b435-43d8-a4aa-bad69d5762c2",
                                "sense_id": "79f1b26a-3503-3d88-9822-ac5b063430b0",
                                "text": "Хорошо придерживаться такого правила: при вдыхании делать три шага и при выдыхании также три шага, причем вдыхать следует носом, а выдыхать ртом."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fa09688a-ad43-37c1-8165-54b9a2c58526",
                        "entry_id": "2260fb0d-35d6-3be3-b3f4-59adbe584333",
                        "glosses": [
                            "быстро, не переводя дыхания, сказать что-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed8ccee2-ec14-48e8-a004-8f1deea1f451",
                                "sense_id": "fa09688a-ad43-37c1-8165-54b9a2c58526",
                                "text": "Медленно, шаг за шагом бредут по коридору. ― Стой, ― выдыхает старуха. ― Годи."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e6ba2b7-a6e2-45c1-afb3-d78d9d42a855",
                                "sense_id": "fa09688a-ad43-37c1-8165-54b9a2c58526",
                                "text": "Ежели был у нее народ, она отзывала отца в спальню, кидалась ему на шею, жарко выдыхала: «Батюшка, родимый батюшка», ― и тихо плакала."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "04bb0137-fbe7-497c-ba8c-20fc7b901390",
                        "source_entry_id": "2260fb0d-35d6-3be3-b3f4-59adbe584333",
                        "target_lang_word": "exhale",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "exhale",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f6cfef7-d0bf-35e4-922b-20f2c469b749",
                                        "entry_id": "b65ea374-6b7f-308a-b1c3-864a09ee6470",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To expel air from the lungs through the nose or mouth by action of the diaphragm, to breathe out."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4538437c-0295-35a7-8132-02d66c39e818",
                                        "entry_id": "b65ea374-6b7f-308a-b1c3-864a09ee6470",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To expel (something, such as tobacco smoke) from the lungs by action of the diaphragm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8029fb71-ddb4-336d-b4ff-66ecac65e8e9",
                                        "entry_id": "b65ea374-6b7f-308a-b1c3-864a09ee6470",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To pass off in the form of vapour; to emerge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f186d8a0-cfb5-4bf1-a01a-e6c2651c949b",
                                                "sense_id": "8029fb71-ddb4-336d-b4ff-66ecac65e8e9",
                                                "text": "Above was a tiled roof – though from that imperfect tiling exhaled stench and pestilence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "152b3967-0671-4ccb-abb8-8fe8de387cc7",
                                                "sense_id": "8029fb71-ddb4-336d-b4ff-66ecac65e8e9",
                                                "text": "Passengers on the earliest railway services would not even have enjoyed the luxury of a platform, instead having to step up onto the waiting open top wagons, where they would experience a journey that left many choking on the plumes of smoke exhaled by the leading locomotive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ac2eb7e-a8b3-3dcb-a477-4c6ab2e7bf79",
                                        "entry_id": "b65ea374-6b7f-308a-b1c3-864a09ee6470",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To emit (a vapour, an odour, etc.)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e51f4e4-d5ed-4baf-8647-ef8fa5a83fc6",
                                                "sense_id": "4ac2eb7e-a8b3-3dcb-a477-4c6ab2e7bf79",
                                                "text": "The earth exhales vapor; marshes exhale noxious effluvia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00d5a74a-5e30-4199-a7ad-44cad0f64576",
                                                "sense_id": "4ac2eb7e-a8b3-3dcb-a477-4c6ab2e7bf79",
                                                "text": "Leſs fragrant Scents th' unfolding Roſe exhales, / Or Spices breathing in Arabian Gales."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1ebf6dd-5d90-34cb-a315-a65f841c6c74",
                                        "entry_id": "b65ea374-6b7f-308a-b1c3-864a09ee6470",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To draw out; to cause to be emitted in vapour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "749aa382-81f5-4519-8cbd-8071600be9ae",
                                                "sense_id": "e1ebf6dd-5d90-34cb-a315-a65f841c6c74",
                                                "text": "The sun exhales the moisture of the earth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "exhale",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23371be9-d36f-367c-935d-d57d59cf4f47",
                                        "entry_id": "f5f21366-29af-3612-b77a-d509e5374302",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An exhalation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65e6b2fb-f656-4471-ba4c-71b35ba66e1a",
                                                "sense_id": "23371be9-d36f-367c-935d-d57d59cf4f47",
                                                "text": "Now have client take slower, normal breaths through the nose and notice how the abdomen moves slightly outward with each inhale and then deflates with each exhale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e7a1a277-ce5b-4dce-b235-35b6299eca4b",
                        "source_entry_id": "2260fb0d-35d6-3be3-b3f4-59adbe584333",
                        "target_lang_word": "breathe out",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "breathe out",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7acdb09-cd7c-3e4b-96a5-e23db17d310b",
                                        "entry_id": "ae616076-a4b8-34ed-9dac-684698a8894e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To exhale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
